    "系统废纸篓可能一并移动旁边的 ._ 文件，已跳过以保留该文件。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Skipped because macOS Trash may also move the adjacent ._ file."
          }
        },
